sequenceDiagram
    actor Business_User as Business_User
    participant VASScheduling as VASScheduling
    participant Wallet as Wallet
    actor VASMgmt as VASMgmt
    Note over Business_User,VASMgmt: VAS unscheduled
    Business_User->>VASScheduling: unschedules VAS scheduling
    VASScheduling->>Wallet: to cancel the VAS reservation
    Wallet->>Wallet: cancels VAS reservation
    Wallet-)Wallet: notifies "VAS Reservation Canceled"
    VASScheduling->>VASScheduling: cancels the VAS schedule
    Note over Business_User,VASMgmt: Scheduled VAS Applied
    VASMgmt->>VASMgmt: identifies scheduled VAS to apply
    VASMgmt->>VASMgmt: applies a VAS and stores details until when its valid
